//go:build !seed

package seeder

// Register is the untagged stand-in for register.go. Without the `seed` build
// tag, register.go and the concrete seed_<name>.go files are compiled out, so
// the production binary carries neither the seed data nor any faker a seeder
// imports. This stub keeps the seeder package the generated Loom seed graph
// references compiling, and registers nothing.
//
// Run the real seeders with the tag:
//
//	go run -tags seed . seed
//	make seed
//	weld seed
func Register(*Registry) {}
